================================================================================
Third-party software distributed with this project
================================================================================

The Docker image built from this repository includes the following software,
which is NOT covered by the PdfWerk licence and remains under its own terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LibreOffice (libreoffice-writer-nogui)
Copyright (c) The Document Foundation
Licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
https://www.libreoffice.org/  |  https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

Used for high-fidelity Word-to-PDF conversion. PdfWerk invokes it as a separate
process via `soffice --convert-to`; it is not linked, embedded, or modified, and
no LibreOffice source is incorporated into PdfWerk. Under MPL-2.0 section 3.2,
source for the unmodified binaries is available from The Document Foundation at
the address above.

LibreOffice is optional. Without it, PdfWerk falls back to its own OpenXML
renderer, and the image can be built without this dependency.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
