Bitstream Vera Fonts Copyright / DejaVu Fonts Licence (permissive, MIT-like)
https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/

Liberation fonts
Copyright (c) 2012 Red Hat, Inc.
SIL Open Font License 1.1
https://github.com/liberationfonts

Installed via the operating system package manager, not vendored into this
repository. PDFsharp ships no fonts and has no default font resolver on Linux,
so at least one font family must be present for rendering to work at all.

